# Toothless Telemetry — MQTT access control list (config-as-code, safe to commit).
#
# With acl_file set + allow_anonymous false, an authenticated user gets ONLY the
# access granted here. Anyone not listed gets nothing. This scopes the `toothless`
# user (the ESP32 publisher + the Mac subscriber) to the project's own topic tree,
# so a leaked credential can't read or write anything outside toothless/#.

user toothless
topic readwrite toothless/#

# The pipeline bridge (Telegraf) only ever SUBSCRIBES to ingest telemetry — least
# privilege, so it gets read-only on the topic tree and cannot publish.
user telegraf
topic read toothless/#
